WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 4 - The Stairs of Fire

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:56.010
With acclaimed movie director Mitsugu Himekawa and famed actress Utako Himekawa as her parents,

00:01:56.010 --> 00:02:00.800
you might assume that Ayumi could only be admired by proxy.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:07.040
But she is actually astonishingly gifted at acting, traditional Japanese dance, ballet, and music.

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:10.450
She's getting top marks at the elite academy she attends.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:13.540
She has quite literally been a star since birth.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:18.300
A girl seemingly born into the starring role.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.740
Out of curiosity, Masumi...

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:37.960
Is Chigusa Tsukikage still refusing to relinquish directorial rights for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>?

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.780
Not only that, but she's also got this idea into her head that she's going to...

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.830
start her own troupe, and personally train the actress she wants to play the Scarlet Angel.

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:50.490
What? It's been a lifelong dream of mine to play the Scarlet Angel...

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:53.200
of that legendary masterpiece...

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.770
Judging from the fact that Chigusa Tsukikage wouldn't even budge when...

00:02:55.770 --> 00:03:01.020
the future CEO of the Daito Corporation and famed director, Onodera, were begging her,

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:04.990
I'm guessing she's a pretty tough nut to crack.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:10.950
No, we'll definitely secure the rights and then I'll be the one putting on the show.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.620
Isn't that right, Masumi?

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:16.090
My father desires nothing more than to acquire the rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:22.520
I feel the same way and I'll do anything to get them.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:24.810
<i>The Scarlet Angel</i>...

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:29.960
Mom, if you let your guard down, I might just steal the lead.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:36.100
Ayumi, you're thirteen. You aren't old enough to play that role just yet.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:42.360
But now, Ms. Tsukikage is going to train an actress herself, isn't she?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.730
If that's the case, I don't see her surrendering the rights that easily...

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:47.410
Not before her student's ready.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:52.030
In five years, I'll be eighteen. That's mature enough, I'd say.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:56.100
It wouldn't be so strange for me to play the Scarlet Angel then.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.060
Utako, she might really steal that role from right under your nose.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.410
Ayumi...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:09.790
Someone who surpasses the acting prowess of Utako Himekawa's...

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.590
She can't mean...

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.990
I can't control myself.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:28.250
Just thinking about acting sets my body alight.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:31.720
My school grades aren't spectacular and we don't have enough money...

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:37.520
to afford acting school, and yet I can't stop myself feeling this way.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.740
Forget about acting as quickly as possible.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:44.350
I-If there's any job I can do, I'll work and...

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:46.080
Save up the admission fees?

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:53.820
That'd be a start. The hardship of earning money while attending middle school...

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:56.090
should steer you clear of acting.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:01.210
Ma'am... I thought you of all people would understand how I feel...

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:04.250
A long time ago, I used to be an actress as well.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.640
An actress?

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:09.880
That's why I'm telling you to give up if this is just a trivial hobby.

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:12.060
It's not trivial!

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:16.090
I'd do anything to be able to act!

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:18.760
Do you really mean that?

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.580
Y-Yes.

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.680
Then follow me.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:27.690
Genzo,

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.340
prepare the car.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.310
It is ready, ma'am.

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.380
The Tsukikage Acting Troupe...

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.870
Do you own this place?

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:11.930
Bingo.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.160
This is my acting school.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.500
The first lesson will be in three weeks' time.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:21.180
Ma'am! Please let me join the troupe!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:24.980
I promise I'll work hard to repay the admission and tuition fees afterwards!

00:06:25.550 --> 00:06:29.870
You'll work? Doing what exactly?

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:33.880
Is acting just a pastime to you?

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.430
You want to do this because you enjoy being in plays?

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.260
Is this all a game to you?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.420
What will you do when you grow up?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.560
Forget acting and work instead?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.300
No, I'm going to become an actress!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.880
I'll definitely grow up to be an actress!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.980
Well said.

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.970
That's what I wanted to hear.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:02.070
Maya, don't lose that determination.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.920
You're going to become an actress.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.400
You have talent, Maya.

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:14.730
Talent means believing in yourself.

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:20.490
Become an actress? I'll become an actress...

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:25.570
I... I'm going to be an actress.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:33.590
You want me to let you go to an acting school in Tokyo?

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.560
Are you out of your mind?

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.310
You don't have that kind of talent!

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:42.770
As your mother, I won't allow it.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:48.020
The new semester's about to start. Why don't you concentrate on studying?

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:52.480
Here you go. A bowl of ramen and dumplings.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:58.400
Please don't make me suffer anymore.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.890
If you don't like me, just say so.

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:03.680
Then I won't chase you anymore.

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.550
If I chase you...

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.700
If I chase you...

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.340
I'll only feel pathetic if I do.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.570
Boy, this girl...

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:17.130
Again?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:27.420
All I do is cause my mother and everyone else grief.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:34.720
Maya, talent means believing in yourself.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:40.080
Even if nobody else can do it, you can.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.860
That's right: you alone can.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:48.640
As long as I live under her roof, my mother will be against this.

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:52.850
I'm going to take acting lessons under Ms. Tsukikage's direction.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.070
I'll run away. I'll run away from home.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.460
That's what I'll do. It's for the best.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.480
Mom...

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.830
I'm sorry.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:21.340
I just can't give up on acting.

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.770
I have nothing else.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.810
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.060
The first train!

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.610
But I'm going to walk. I've walked this far already.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.310
You've come over this early?

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:07.620
Ma'am, please let me be one of your boarders!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.570
Please let me stay here!

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.030
Did your mother agree to let you stay here?

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.000
Y-Yes!

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:26.110
Let me introduce you all to a new boarder.

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:28.020
Maya Kitajima from Yokohama.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.770
Nice to meet you.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:35.110
I'm Mina Sawatari from Hokkaido. Ms. Tsukikage brought me here.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:40.270
Same here, but I'm from Hakata in Kyushu. I'm Taiko Kasuga. Nice to meet you.

00:10:40.270 --> 00:10:45.640
I'm Sayaka Minazuki from Nagano. It's great to make more friends.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:51.430
I'm Rei Aoki, the oldest of this rabble. I'm from Tokyo. It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:53.130
So handsome!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.300
Uh, you realize I'm a girl, don't you?

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:58.010
You are? Oops...

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.320
Oh no, it's nighttime already!

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.160
How long have I been asleep?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.120
Have you just woken up?

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.770
Just in time. We're about to have dinner.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:23.470
To welcome our new arrival, I'll order whatever everyone wants to eat.

00:11:23.470 --> 00:11:24.960
Awesome!

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.790
What does everyone want to eat?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.450
I want a Korean barbecue!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.610
I want pasta and salad!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.940
I want a really spicy curry!

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.590
I want a three-course Italian meal!

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.020
What about you, Maya?

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:41.400
Um, uh... a bowl of ramen.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:45.170
You silly! She said we could have whatever we wanted!

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:47.800
But I couldn't think of anything else.

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:52.750
Okay, everyone: go to the dining room and eat what you've ordered.

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:55.800
What? It's already been prepared?

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:06.040
Expression through gestures. Pantomime.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:10.480
Now, act as though you're eating your favorite dish.

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:19.090
Rei!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.260
Who'd eat their favorite curry...

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.670
with an expression like they're eating dirt?!

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.430
Act as though it tastes good.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.430
Got it.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.600
Mina!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:29.750
Why are you eating so listlessly?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:33.340
But ma'am, I'm really hungry...

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:34.860
Listen up!

00:12:34.860 --> 00:12:40.750
When you're on stage, you have to eat from an empty prop as though it's a delicious meal,

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:46.170
and even if you're full, you might have to act like you're starving.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:50.250
That's why you have to pay attention to the smallest of details!

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:53.530
She's a harsh taskmistress...

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:09.990
Was I eating oddly?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.370
No, it looked pretty good, Maya.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.100
I can tell that...

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:18.800
you've been working in a Chinese restaurant for quite a while.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:24.050
Oh? A Chinese restaurant, eh? I guess that's why she's had such...

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.740
close study on how to eat ramen.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.900
Don't say things like that.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.020
Listen up, everyone...

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:34.280
Each tiny and meaningless everyday gesture forms part of the foundation of acting.

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:38.010
Pay attention to every detail and memorize everything.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:39.190
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.350
Okay, let's eat!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.230
Genzo!

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:47.340
The Kanto region will continue to see some nice weather tomorrow.

00:13:48.230 --> 00:13:50.370
Huh? Where's Maya gone?

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:52.880
She's doing the dishes in the kitchen.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:56.740
She's apparently getting a scholarship to cover the tuition fees here.

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:58.010
A scholarship?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:01.640
How long has she been studying acting?

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.750
That's just it. Apparently, this is the first time.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.920
Her first time?

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:10.970
I can't believe Ms. Tsukikage would offer a scholarship to a total amateur!

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:16.840
Why would she go as far as exempting her from paying her tuition just so she can join?

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.800
Entrance Ceremony

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:24.560
I'm going to be overseeing the lessons,

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:29.020
so this will be radically different from ordinary schools.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:38.010
Even though she was a megastar, Masumi, that was some thirty years ago.

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:43.800
I don't imagine she has enough money to pull off a stunt like this.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.440
It seems she doesn't have any money left,

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:53.040
and she's sold off all her land, her stocks and her jewels ten years ago.

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:56.030
Not to mention her mansion in Yokohama...

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.280
Then, where's she getting the money for that troupe of hers?

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:03.720
It looks like she has a mysterious benefactor in the wings.

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:05.450
In the wings?

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:09.260
In any case, we can't let the Tsukikage Acting Troupe prosper.

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.880
I'll make sure it crashes and burns!

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:19.360
You can't come in here with shoes on!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:20.950
Shut up, you kidnapper!

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.800
Let go of me!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:24.270
Bring me my daughter!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:29.420
Mom?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:33.850
I knew it! This is where you've got to! I've looked everywhere for you!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.360
How dare you run away from your home! You ingrate!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.470
Come with me. We're going home.

00:15:38.470 --> 00:15:39.360
No!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:40.540
No!

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:44.170
No, I'm not going home!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:45.930
What are you talking about?

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:48.480
I'll take you home even if I have to put a leash on you!

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:50.900
Maya!

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:52.800
Maya!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.580
Open up!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.020
Open this door, Maya!

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:01.690
Please stop.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.040
I'm Chigusa Tsukikage.

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:08.700
So you're the "teacher" who hypnotized my daughter?

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.220
Stop this, Mom!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:13.280
It was my own decision to run away.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.020
She's got nothing to do with it.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:16.230
Maya!

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:20.540
We're going home, Maya.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:25.530
A talentless girl like you can never become an actress!

00:16:25.530 --> 00:16:27.570
You're being lied to!

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:31.730
What are you doing?

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:35.080
I'm not letting her leave with you.

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:39.820
Why won't you believe that she has potential?!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:45.220
Even if she only has one mere talent, I'd be able to release and nurture it.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:47.600
Who do you think you are?!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.830
You don't know anything.

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:52.220
You're not even a mother! Now, move!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.950
Now, let me through!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.290
I'm taking my daughter home!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.290
No.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:58.710
I won't let you pass.

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:06.090
Maya might be a failure to you, but to me, she's a diamond in the rough!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:08.730
Ma'am...

00:17:09.710 --> 00:17:12.980
If you won't move aside, I'll throw this boiling water over you!

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:14.650
I'm not bluffing!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.390
M-Mom!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:20.980
Even if you do, I still can't let you pass!

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:23.230
You're all talk!

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:24.870
She's not even your daughter.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:28.720
When it comes down to it, you'll only save your own skin!

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.680
I'm serious! Get out of my way!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.030
I refuse!

00:17:33.260 --> 00:17:34.570
Mom...

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.200
You!

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.840
To an actress, her face means everything.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:57.530
If her face had been badly burned by boiling water, her life would be over!

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:02.440
Please entrust Maya to me.

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:09.900
Mom, I'm sorry. I want to give acting a go!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.240
You selfish brat!

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:14.150
Mom...

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:18.000
You're... You're...

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:22.320
You're no longer my daughter!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:27.300
Mom!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:31.900
Ma'am!

00:18:32.680 --> 00:18:37.470
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry!

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:46.370
These are the masks you need to practice your acting skills.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:50.580
The mask of tears, the mask of laughter, the mask of anger.

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:54.330
They are masks that express three basic human emotions.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:58.970
By using these three masks alone, you can put on a play.

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:02.130
Just like earlier.

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.520
Ma'am...

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:07.350
Your mother wore the mask of anger.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:10.600
You wore the mask of tears.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:15.970
And everyone watching wore the mask of laughter.

00:19:16.360 --> 00:19:20.600
But these aren't the only human emotions.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:24.500
Jealousy, joy, hatred, admiration, distaste...

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.200
An actress must wear countless masks.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:35.170
Remember: everything that happens in life is connected to acting.

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:38.900
You have a thousand masks to wear, Maya.

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.590
A thousand masks?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.300
Even though no one else can see it, I know it's true.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:47.780
You're the girl with a thousand masks!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:20:01.800
My behavior yesterday was inexcusable and I apologize for it.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:07.470
I've come to realize that, like you, I want her to follow her dreams.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:14.590
Letting go of my only daughter is almost unbearable, and the sadness and the loneliness cuts me like a knife.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:19.500
Please take care of my daughter. I'm sending her a change of clothes.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:24.970
Please give them to her. And if you could, please let me know how she's doing from time to time.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:28.630
Genzo, burn this package immediately!

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:36.720
She needs separating from her past at this juncture in her life.

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.580
Imagine what would happen if she turned back, after she's finally understood...

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:41.930
just how steep the mountain she has to climb is,

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:43.800
and sees the warm glow of home!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:46.740
If she realizes that her only option is to battle onwards,

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:49.690
she'll steel herself and keep climbing,

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:52.800
desiring nothing else but to see the sun at the summit.

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:57.050
Utako Himekawa and Ayumi Himekawa...

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:59.740
The much anticipated performance of mother and daughter.

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:04.620
Over a hundred reporters have packed into the press conference here at the Teito Hotel.

00:21:05.210 --> 00:21:09.460
Ayumi, do you plan to become an actress like your mother?

00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:14.340
No, I don't plan on becoming an actress like my mother.

00:21:14.340 --> 00:21:17.270
I intend to become an actress who is <i>better</i> than my mother.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:22.980
And I intend to become internationally recognized as an actress.

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:28.010
I am committed to devoting my whole life to acting.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:32.520
No matter what happens, I will always believe in myself...

00:21:32.520 --> 00:21:35.250
and climb the ladder to success one step at a time.

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:39.650
A new determination is burning inside Maya Kitajima.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:44.200
The world of acting that Maya has jumped into by cutting her ties with her mother..

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:50.030
Will Maya be able to compete with Ayumi Himekawa, her eternal rival?

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
Gomennette iwaretara

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
When you say "I'm sorry,"

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
Anata wo semerarenai yo

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
I can't blame you.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
Sonna watashi wo kitto shitterundeshou

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
I'm sure you know that's how I am.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
Nee zurui yo

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
That's not fair.

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Yasashisa ni damasaretatte

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Even if I'm being fooled by kindness,

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
Anata nara isso iito shinjita

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
I believed that with you, it might be worth it.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Sayonara wa doushite itoshiindarou

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Why are goodbyes so precious,

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
Hanareteyuku noni

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
even though they mean we're separating?

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
Ushinatta ondo wo oboeteruyo

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
I remember how it got colder.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
Yurushitai dakara anata

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
I want to forgive you, so please don't go.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Ikanaide douka ikanaide

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Whatever you do... just don't go.

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:26.080
The purple rose that never turned blue.

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:31.910
People might see it as a failure, but it's potentially the first stage of change.

00:23:32.660 --> 00:23:38.780
Little one, how will you progress when you're faced with Ayumi Himekawa's challenge?

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:45.060
You still don't know <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> that has captured Ayumi's heart.

00:23:45.430 --> 00:23:50.030
I'm sure your life will also progress quickly because of it.

00:23:47.370 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 5 - Limited Lines
